{
  "name": "Goofish (闲鱼) All-in-One: Search, Sellers & Reviews — Automated Extraction to CSV & Sheets (UnitBytes)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⚡ Goofish (闲鱼) All-in-One: Search, Sellers & Reviews — Automated n8n Pipeline\n**Powered by [UnitBytes on Apify](https://apify.com/unitbytes/goofish-scraper?fpr=939u3w&fp_sid=n8n_io)** ($0.008 / item)\n\n### ⚙️ How It Works\nThis workflow runs on a schedule, calls the **[goofish-scraper Apify Actor](https://apify.com/unitbytes/goofish-scraper?fpr=939u3w&fp_sid=n8n_io)** via its synchronous REST endpoint, normalizes the extracted fields (`rowStatus, recordType, sellerId, sellerName, sellerCreditRating`), and exports a clean CSV file.\n\n### 🚀 30-Second Setup Instructions\n1. **Get your free Apify API Token**: Open [goofish-scraper on Apify Store](https://apify.com/unitbytes/goofish-scraper?fpr=939u3w&fp_sid=n8n_io) and copy your API token from **Settings → Integrations**.\n2. **Paste your token & search parameters**: Double-click the **\"1. Set Apify Token & Input\"** node and replace `YOUR_APIFY_API_TOKEN` with your token.\n3. **Click \"Test Workflow\"**: The HTTP Request node calls the synchronous UnitBytes Apify endpoint, normalizes the extracted records, and exports a clean CSV file ready for Google Sheets, Airtable, Slack, or OpenAI.\n\n📖 **Documentation & Schema Reference**: [https://unitbytes.com/actors/goofish-xianyu-seller-scraper/](https://unitbytes.com/actors/goofish-xianyu-seller-scraper/)",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "8f2e7c46-cd48-539c-aa23-63c59d7bb5ed",
      "name": "Sticky Note — Setup Guide",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 📊 Connect Your Destination\nThe **\"3. Normalize Output Fields\"** node outputs flat records (`rowStatus, recordType, sellerId, sellerName, sellerCreditRating`).\n\n- **Google Sheets / Airtable**: Connect a Google Sheets (`Append or Update Row`) node after Step 3.\n- **Slack / Telegram / Email Alerts**: Connect a Filter node + Slack node to alert your team on new deals or reviews.\n- **AI Agent / OpenAI**: Connect an OpenAI / LLM Chain node to summarize or classify extracted items.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "b8c242cb-c499-5693-b3db-448c4be8770d",
      "name": "Sticky Note — Destinations",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        880,
        140
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "hours",
              "hoursInterval": 24
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "f1192ccb-ec0d-5d7e-aaa7-aff369efcfa1",
      "name": "Schedule Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        220,
        480
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "232bd29a-08aa-5859-92c0-3019dac03dd9",
              "name": "apifyToken",
              "value": "YOUR_APIFY_API_TOKEN",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "bb8a55e7-964f-5310-8df8-cbf7f33ad02d",
              "name": "actorInput",
              "value": "{\"mode\": \"search\", \"keyword\": \"iPhone 15\", \"maxItems\": 20, \"sortBy\": \"newest\", \"includeListings\": true, \"includeReviews\": true, \"maxListings\": 20, \"maxReviews\": 30}",
              "type": "object"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b46816c3-bf32-55e2-b40b-b9773da72d86",
      "name": "1. Set Apify Token & Input",
